WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.675
Dividing by a negative reverses the inequality.

2
00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:08.351
Minus two x is more than six on the left of minus three.

3
00:00:09.455 --> 00:00:14.130
So x is less than minus three. Dividing by minus two turned it round.

4
00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:18.934
Check: minus four gives eight, and eight is more than six.
